Meri Tarah Guitar Chords with strumming pattern easy lesson sung by Jubin Nautiyal.

Strumming Pattern: DDUDDUDDUDD OR D DU U DU

[Am]Kaun hai wo duniya mein jo,        Tujhe [G]mujhse badhkar [C]chahane laga
[Am]Jis ke liye tu haath mera,        Ik [G]pal mein chhod ke [C]jane laga
