[G]Bahut fark hota hai,        Yoon [F]sath musku [Am]rane mein
[G]Hath thamne mein aur,        [F]Zindagi bi [Am]taane mein

[G]Jeene marne ki baatein,        [F]Karke bhool [Am]jaate hain
[G]Kya kisi ka jaaye jhoothe,        [F]Khwab sau di [F]khane mein

